+## External API Write Safety
+
+Per CLAUDE.md § External API Write Safety Rule 3:
+
+- All `portfolio_tools` instances in tests are `MagicMock` with `AsyncMock` methods — they never reach Amazon.
+- `acquire_cron_write_bypass`/`release_cron_write_bypass` operate entirely in-process using `contextvars.ContextVar` and a `set[str]` — zero I/O.
+- TC-12 contractually verifies this: it patches `httpx.AsyncClient.send` and asserts it is never called.
+- Tests do NOT start the FastAPI application server. No route handlers are invoked.
